{"title": "Die designs", "pageid": 6861, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Die_designs", "categories": ["Game content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dice_Design_interface.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Dice_Design_interface.webp/300px-Dice_Design_interface.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Dice_Design_interface.webp/450px-Dice_Design_interface.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Dice_Design_interface.webp/600px-Dice_Design_interface.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Dice_Design_interface.webp/300px-Dice_Design_interface.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"238\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Dice_Design_interface.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The user interface for choosing a die design</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\nA <b>die design</b> (or \"dice skin\") is a selectable cosmetic appearance for the twenty-sided dice used in <a href=\"/wiki/Die_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Die Rolls\">die rolls</a>. The design is seen on the animated dice used for  <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> (and sometimes <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>) initiated by player actions, like <a href=\"/wiki/Dialogue\" title=\"Dialogue\">dialogue</a> choices or <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">lockpicking</a>. The active design can be changed from the Ability Check overlay via a setting in the bottom left corner. The selected skin is for the player, rather than per save or character, but can be changed at any time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Core_designs\">Core designs</span></h2>\n<p>These die designs are available to all players on all platforms.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Behir Blue - made available to all players in Hotfix #3</li>\n<li>Scuffed Metal - the default design</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlockable_designs\">Unlockable designs</span></h2>\n<p>These die designs are available to all players, but only if certain conditions are fulfilled.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Shining Honour - reward for completing the game in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a> (added in Patch #5)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exclusive_designs\">Exclusive designs</span></h2>\n<p>These die designs are only available with certain versions of the game.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Digital_Deluxe_Upgrade\" title=\"Digital Deluxe Upgrade\">Digital Deluxe Upgrade</a> includes an additional design which is unique to the platform the player bought it on:\n<ul><li>Dragonflame Red - PC exclusive</li>\n<li>Prismatic Spray - PS5 exclusive</li>\n<li>Xanathar's Barter - Xbox exclusive</li></ul></li>\n<li>Illithid Purple - available only to players who purchased the Physical Collector's Edition</li>\n<li>Dice of Hope and Despair - <i>Danganronpa</i>-themed design (with Monokuma motif) available only to players who pre-ordered the PS5 version in Japan by December 20, 2023<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Core die designs</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 141.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 139.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scuffed_Metal_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Scuffed Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Scuffed_Metal_die.png/209px-Scuffed_Metal_die.png.webp, /w/images/9/9b/Scuffed_Metal_die.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scuffed Metal die design (from game files)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Scuffed_Metal_die.png/209px-Scuffed_Metal_die.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Scuffed_Metal_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Scuffed Metal</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 141.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 139.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Behir_Blue_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Behir Blue\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Behir_Blue_die.png/209px-Behir_Blue_die.png.webp, /w/images/c/c3/Behir_Blue_die.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Behir Blue die design (from game files)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Behir_Blue_die.png/209px-Behir_Blue_die.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Behir_Blue_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Behir Blue</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Unlockable die designs</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 141.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 139.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Shining_Honour_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Shining Honour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Shining_Honour_die.png/209px-Shining_Honour_die.png.webp, /w/images/a/ad/Shining_Honour_die.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Shining Honour die design (from game files)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Shining_Honour_die.png/209px-Shining_Honour_die.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Shining_Honour_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Shining Honour</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Exclusive die designs</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 140.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 138.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dragonflame_Red_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dragonflame Red PC\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Dragonflame_Red_die.png/208px-Dragonflame_Red_die.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Dragonflame_Red_die.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dragonflame Red die design (from game files)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Dragonflame_Red_die.png/208px-Dragonflame_Red_die.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"139\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Dragonflame_Red_die.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Dragonflame Red<br>PC</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 141.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 139.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Prismatic Spray PS5\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp/209px-Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp, /w/images/7/76/Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Prismatic Spray die design\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp/209px-Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"140\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Prismatic_Spray_die_design.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" 